@startuml
title 006 計時搶答與計分板 - 類別圖

class Activity {
  stage
  timeLimitSeconds
  deadlineAt
  worksheet
  questions
}

class AcceptedSubmission {
  groupId
  questionId
  receivedAt
  answer
}

class QuestionResult {
  questionId
  winningGroupId
  winningAnswer
}

class CorrectnessMark {
  questionId
  judgement: CORRECT | INCORRECT
}

class GroupStanding {
  groupId
  score
  successfulQuestionCount
  rank
}

class StudentAnswerProgress {
  groupId
  submittedQuestionCount
  totalQuestionCount
}

class ActivityTimer {
  deadlineAt
  remainingSeconds
  timerRunning
  -generation
  -scheduledHandle
  +start()
  +stop()
}

class ScoringService {
  +markCorrectness(questionId, judgement)
  +getScoreboard()
  +clear()
}

Activity "1" o-- "0..1" ActivityTimer
Activity "1" o-- "0..*" AcceptedSubmission
Activity "1" o-- "0..*" QuestionResult
QuestionResult "0..1" --> "1" AcceptedSubmission : successful answer
QuestionResult "1" o-- "0..1" CorrectnessMark
Activity "1" o-- "1" ScoringService
ScoringService --> QuestionResult : winner and current judgement
GroupStanding "*" --> "1" GroupRoster : groupId
StudentAnswerProgress "*" --> "1" GroupRoster : groupId

note right of CorrectnessMark
僅老師在活動結束後設定。
只對有成功組別的題目建立。
每題至多一個目前判定。
end note

note bottom of GroupStanding
score = 對標記數。
successfulQuestionCount 不受正誤標記影響。
排序：score 降冪、成功題數降冪、
組別編號升冪。
end note

note right of StudentAnswerProgress
題組視為一個主題。
僅搶答中顯示，僅計本組已接受作答。
end note

note right of Activity
老師確認重設後：
回到準備中並保留 worksheet / questions；
清除本場答案、成功結果與標記，
timeLimitSeconds 設為 0。
end note

class GroupRoster {
  groupIds
}
@enduml
